%% Long axis texts and quadrant texts: the reference does not fit them, so they run past the
%% quadrant, and the labels keep their anchors.
quadrantChart
  title A chart title that is long enough to be wider than the quadrants it sits over
  x-axis A left axis text that is quite long for the x axis --> And the right one is long too
  y-axis A bottom text on the y axis that is long --> And a top text that is long as well
  quadrant-1 We should expand the work on this quadrant by a great deal
  quadrant-2 Need to promote this one to the people who need it most
  quadrant-3 Re-evaluate the things in this quadrant with a careful eye
  quadrant-4 May be improved over time as the work goes on and on
  Point with a long label for the chart: [0.3, 0.6]
  Short: [0.7, 0.2]
